config EERIE_LEAP_ADC
    bool "EerieLeap ADC"
    help
      Add EerieLeap ADC.

menu "EerieLeap ADC config"
    depends on EERIE_LEAP_ADC

    config EERIE_LEAP_ADC_SAMPLES_MAX
        int "Maximum conversions averaged per channel"
        range 1 65535
        default 4096
        help
          Upper bound for the samples of a sample request; a request asking
          for more is clamped. Every conversion blocks the sampling thread,
          so size this for the slowest driver on the unit rather than for
          the configuration.

    config EERIE_LEAP_ADC_BURST_CHUNK
        int "Samplings per driver call"
        range 1 1024
        default 64
        help
          How many samplings one adc_read() performs on a driver that
          accepts extra_samplings. Each ADC keeps a buffer of this many
          samples per channel in internal RAM; a request for more samples
          is served in several calls.
endmenu
